    "description": "<p><strong>Advanced Move.</strong> When you declare a specific type of creature to be your Favored Quarry (goblins, mages, ghosts, etc.), say how their kind wronged you and what you plan to do in return. Until you achieve it in full you cannot declare another Favored Quarry. Your Favored Quarry takes an extra condition from all of your attacks, can never surprise you, and is always treated as a dangerous monster to you.</p>",
